land, a new MMORPG, brings back the fun of challenging dungeons and\u00a0experiencing\u00a0immersive adventures in a classic fantasy art style. Choose from 9 classes and 18 specializations to create your build. Team up globally to conquer epic bosses!<br><br><strong>Explore the Vast World</strong><br>Dive into the vast realm of Tarisland, uncover hidden mysteries, and embark on your unique adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/e406c0c0339d3047ecfc8c84f14fa1f1.poster.avif?t=1762434696\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/e406c0c0339d3047ecfc8c84f14fa1f1.webm?t=1762434696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/e406c0c0339d3047ecfc8c84f14fa1f1.mp4?t=1762434696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Class &amp; Talent System</strong><br>Tarisland offers 9 unique classes, each with 2 specializations for you to choose from.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/7afcbaaf981959f5f7e26669633f622e.poster.avif?t=1762434696\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/7afcbaaf981959f5f7e26669633f622e.webm?t=1762434696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126180/extras/7afcbaaf981959f5f7e26669633f622e.mp4?t=1762434696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Create Your Own Build</strong><br>Each class features a flexible and extensive talent tree, easily customizable for different playstyles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" aut